// v1 it is an **opaque provenance token**: no wire method reads what it points at (the SS6
// raw-log altitude is deferred, #13929). Ephemeral-sourced events (`item/delta`, and an
// `item/started` that opens on an ephemeral record) carry no `sourceRange` — ephemeral
